  "title": "Rich Hazelnut Coffee Pods (Medium Roast)",
  "handle": "rich-hazelnut-coffee-pods-medium-roast",
  "body_html": "<p><strong>Rich Hazelnut Coffee Pods </strong>turn a cozy blend into an easy, single-serve brew. This cup truly has it all - chocolate-covered almond notes, warm maple syrup sweetness, and a hint of citrus. All packed into a blend that’s made for an excellent performance in a pod format.</p><p><br></p><p>This<strong> medium roast </strong>blend combines Brazilian beans for body and chocolate depth with Mexican varietals that add balance and a clean, citrusy edge. The Brazilian Catuaí, Catucaí, and Mundo Novo varietals bring the classic, rich coffee taste, while the Mexican Bourbon and Typica varietals provide bright structure and sweetness. The result is a cup that stands out from the usual pod lineup.</p><p><br></p><p>It's a flavorful roast that fits any routine and will be admired for its quality.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> 100% Arabica</p><p><strong>Varietals:</strong> Bourbon, Typica, Catuaí, Catucaí, Mundo Novo</p><p><strong>Acidity level:</strong> Medium</p><p><strong>Manufacturer's country: </strong>USA</p><p><strong>Regions: </strong>Brazil, Mexico</p><p><strong>Product amount (oz/lb/g):</strong> 12 pods / 4.7oz / 0.31lb / 139g</p><p><strong>Gross weight (oz/lb/g): </strong>7.5oz / 0.47lb / 212g</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Do not use if the packaging is damaged or opened. Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and moisture.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Works with most Keurig-compatible machines, including Keurig, Cuisinart, Hamilton Beach, Black &amp; Decker, and more.</p><p><strong>Not compatible: </strong>Specialty machines such as Nespresso, Ninja, Lavazza, or Dolce Gusto.</p> <p>\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/4c36cdfa54b26cb4291c359dc2cd7910d868f8ae-125x181.png\" alt=\"Gluten-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/2390692fa16a1bad9ae4453609bcd8b61afbb0b2-149x180.png\" alt=\"Vegetarian\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/cc4066d915d42e195ee9cf5bbce01a99f006af1e-126x181.png\" alt=\"Lactose-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/f7e562d6bb212503da89f944a0d799171e6d48fe-125x181.png\" alt=\"Allergen-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/e2132e2f64f15727e375c7aa509fedd7bdcf1ae8-126x182.png\" alt=\"Hormone-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/28d7e07bb105f5cdb78b23808a653158de4f4b70-125x182.png\" alt=\"All natural\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/f99540cc3d3f192a68004f4518d57b0cd7c27aa7-125x181.png\" alt=\"Antibiotic-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/0e9fc04e2f9353234d2b7794b96613f19c576efb-126x183.png\" alt=\"Non-GMO\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/a007d72855c1d7a309b8b6dec5eadf939bb8a80d-125x181.png\" alt=\"Corn-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/392fe7a0ceded284f4aeb9c2eeb40c638917d6be-149x180.png\" alt=\"Vegan friendly\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/5d63559a8d2977b109844a6f2e231d646d51c76d-520x641.png\" alt=\"Halal\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/fcded08d85e2c6a9aa898fa2748178b41414fe13-126x182.png\" alt=\"Cruelty Free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\"></p>",
